# bat pages through less, so the keys inside it are less's keys. Only the few
# that differ are worth a row of their own — see the less view for the rest.
name:    bat
what:    the keys once bat has opened a file and handed you to the pager
check:   bat
install: sudo dnf install bat   /   sudo apt install bat   (binary: batcat)
docs:    h inside it, which is less's own help

= IT IS A PAGER, SO
q                | quit
/text            | search. Every `less` key applies here
Space            | one screen forward
g / G            | top / bottom
